                                        "entry_id": "dee63797-0c28-325f-9686-a814398fc540",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The member of staff at a restaurant who keeps the wine cellar, advises guests on the choice of wines and serves them; a waiter who is also in charge of the wine cellar and other duties normally assigned to sommeliers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e59f352-014c-4693-b8a6-b62922177075",
                                                "sense_id": "a413af67-c126-3f56-a221-2802077cedeb",
                                                "text": "Waiters paused in their hurrying to and fro, and stood with dishes in their hands, watching the curiously circling birds. A wine waiter, who had been serving some priceless Burgundy, went on pouring it until the wine was trickling in a little stream across the table-cloth on to the floor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74b38a07-d6b6-4f99-a2ce-9aa77d9cece8",
                                                "sense_id": "a413af67-c126-3f56-a221-2802077cedeb",
                                                "text": "[…] she listened admiringly while Cass, who knew nothing whatever about the subject, held a symposium on sauternes with the wine-waiter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4dcc2010-4248-487a-87b0-dc69d9d961cc",
                                                "sense_id": "a413af67-c126-3f56-a221-2802077cedeb",
                                                "text": "Sometimes I hear people asking “Can you recommend a wine to go with the salmon (or whatever)?” To which the wine waiter’s first response should surely be—though I have never heard a wine waiter ask it—“How much do you want to spend exactly?”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
